
Hindsight (development image)

  hindsightd log:   /var/log/hindsight/hindsightd.log
  interface log:    /var/log/hindsight/session.log
  app data:         /var/lib/hindsight/apps/<app>     (Btrfs subvolumes)
  snapshots:        /var/lib/hindsight/snapshots/<app>/<time>

  rc-service hindsight-session restart     reload the interface
  btrfs subvolume list /                   see every snapshot

